# Doomsday Cyberdeck — Master Parts List

## Project Overview

A rugged, battery-powered portable computer built around a Raspberry Pi 5, a 13.3-inch HDMI display, a Bluetooth keyboard/trackpad, and two removable SATA hard drives. The case will be selected later, with a preference for a large, hard-sided equipment case that has enough room for the electronics, battery, cooling, cabling, and one removable drive bay on each side.

**Current known subtotal:** $347 before tax and shipping.

**Status key**
- `[OWNED]` — Already owned.
- `[SELECTED]` — Chosen for the build.
- `[BUY]` — Still needs to be purchased.
- `[VERIFY]` — Confirm specifications or compatibility before buying.
- `[CASE-DEPENDENT]` — Depends on the final case dimensions and layout.
- `[OPTIONAL]` — Useful addition, but not essential to the initial build.

